--- !u!114 &955590617
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 955590616}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9b82723acb954704c950f2be5983528e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KineticEnergy.UI.SectionIntroHud
  showHud: 1
  sections: {fileID: 1132250274}
  sectionTexts:
  - 'THE BASICS

    Charge a launch by holding Right Mouse and press Left Mouse
    to fire.'
  - 'MOVING PLATFORMS

    The ghost copy shows where a platform will be when you
    land.'
  - 'ROTATING WALLS

    The broad faces are safe to land on and are sticky, meaning
    you can''t fall off. The thin red edges knock you back and cost energy.'
  - 'LASER GATES

    If you hit the beams they deal knockback and drain energy.'
  - 'GROUNDED ENEMIES

    If you dodge their attack, they light up and become vulnerable
    to kill. The amount of energy needed to kill is shown the same way as the checkpoints.'
  - 'TURRET ENEMIES

    They fire a burst of shots. And also show their required
    energy to kill the same way as the grounded enemies.'
  - 'FLYING ENEMIES

    They shoot on sight. Only a hit on the back cube kills them.
    Hit anywhere else to stun them and you land on their back. Their weakspot shows
    the amount of energy to kill.'
  sectionTextsGamepad:
  - 'THE BASICS

    Charge a launch by holding Left Trigger and press Right Trigger
    to fire.'
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  proximitySteps:
  - label: Basics - re-aim
    target: {fileID: 1457202609}
    targetEnd: {fileID: 431391796}
    radius: 14
    text: 'THE BASICS

      When midair, hold the aim button again to slow time
      and re-aim. Move the Scroll Wheel up/down to add or remove energy. You can
      also launch upwards by holding and releasing Space.'
    gamepadText: 'THE BASICS

      When midair, hold the aim button again to slow
      time and re-aim. Move the Right Stick up/down to add or remove energy. You
      can also launch upwards by holding and releasing A.'
  - label: Basics - checkpoints
    target: {fileID: 436884720}
    targetEnd: {fileID: 0}
    radius: 22
    text: 'CHECKPOINTS

      Activate one by crashing using a regular launch down
      or a ground pound by pressing E. You need atleast as much energy as is indicated
      by the colour of the button, which matches the colour the amount on the energy
      meter. This also resets your energy meter.'
    gamepadText: 'CHECKPOINTS

      Activate one by crashing using a regular launch
      down or a ground pound by pressing X. You need atleast as much energy as is
      indicated by the colour of the button, which matches the colour the amount
      on the energy meter. This also resets your energy meter.'
  panelWidth: 440
  gamepadStickDeadzone: 0.35
